---
/**
 * Employee conversation view — request thread with composer.
 */
---

<figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200/80 bg-canvas shadow-[var(--shadow-quiet)]">
  <div class="border-b border-zinc-200/80 bg-surface px-5 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-5">
    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <p class="text-[0.75rem] text-zinc-400">New request / REQ-3 · Set up a shared mailbox</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-[1.25rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[1.375rem]">
          REQ-3 Set up a shared mailbox
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] text-zinc-500">Routed to IT Help Desk · Open</p>
      </div>
      <button
        type="button"
        tabindex="-1"
        class="shrink-0 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-ink"
      >
        Mark as resolved
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-4 px-4 py-5 sm:px-6 sm:py-6">
    <div class="flex justify-end">
      <div class="max-w-[min(100%,28rem)] rounded-2xl bg-accent px-4 py-3 text-white shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-[0.6875rem] font-medium text-white/75">You · 24 Aug, 13:33</p>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed">
          Need to create a new mailbox called qa@openrequest.co and make me and Tommy and Alfie as
          members.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex justify-start">
      <div class="max-w-[min(100%,28rem)] rounded-2xl bg-zinc-100 px-4 py-3 text-ink">
        <p class="text-[0.6875rem] font-medium text-zinc-500">Rolo Rex · 24 Aug, 13:37</p>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-zinc-700">
          Hi Nic — thanks for raising this. We are currently creating the mailbox and will delegate
          to the members as requested.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-zinc-200/80 bg-surface px-4 py-3 sm:px-5">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-2.5">
      <p class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-[0.875rem] text-zinc-400">Write a message...</p>
      <span
        class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent text-white"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none">
          <path
            d="M2.5 7h9M7.5 3.5L11 7l-3.5 3.5"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>
